  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "textvqa",
  "description": "TextVQA requires models to read and reason about text in images to answer questions about them.\nSpecifically, models need to incorporate a new modality of text present in the images and reason\nover it to answer TextVQA questions. TextVQA dataset contains 45,336 questions over 28,408 images\nfrom the OpenImages dataset.",
